build‐time  tests.  The C++ compiler flags used by the ATF checks
that provide build‐time tests.  The path to  the  directory  that
contains  the  system‐wide configuration files for ATF.  The path
to the directory that contains the ATF header files.  The path to
the directory that contains the ATF libraries.  The path  to  the
directory  that contains the auxiliary utilities of ATF, used in‐
